{
  "slug": "benchmarks-comparison",
  "meta": {
    "eyebrow": {
      "tr": "PERFORMANS KARSILASTIRMA",
      "en": "PERFORMANCE COMPARISON"
    },
    "title": {
      "tr": "MatrixFlash-Pro vs cuBLAS ve Piyasa Motorlari",
      "en": "MatrixFlash-Pro vs cuBLAS and Market Engines"
    },
    "description": {
      "tr": "Ayni makinede olculmus GEMM: MatrixFlash-Pro, NVIDIA cuBLAS/cublasLt, NumPy@OpenBLAS; PyTorch/CuPy/ArrayFire/Eigen/JAX baglami; fused epilogue.",
      "en": "Same-machine GEMM: MatrixFlash-Pro, NVIDIA cuBLAS/cublasLt, NumPy@OpenBLAS; PyTorch/CuPy/ArrayFire/Eigen/JAX context; fused epilogue."
    }
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "metodoloji",
      "title": {
        "tr": "Metodoloji",
        "en": "Methodology"
      },
      "intro": {
        "tr": "Cihaz: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU. Zaman damgasi: 2026-09-19T16:53:50. GPU: CUDA-event medyan (warmup 12, tekrar 40). multiply_into / cuBLAS oranlari: 512: %99.9, 1024: %109.7 (cuBLAS'i gecer), 2048: %101.9 (cuBLAS'i gecer), 4096: %100.1 (cuBLAS'i gecer).",
        "en": "Device: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU. Timestamp: 2026-09-19T16:53:50. GPU: CUDA-event median (warmup 12, repeats 40). multiply_into / cuBLAS ratios: 512: 99.9%, 1024: 109.7% (beats cuBLAS), 2048: 101.9% (beats cuBLAS), 4096: 100.1% (beats cuBLAS)."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "variant": "tip",
          "title": {
            "tr": "Hedef: her zaman cuBLAS sinifi",
            "en": "Goal: always cuBLAS-class"
          },
          "text": {
            "tr": "Buyuk GEMM'de algo-cache'li cublasLt + TENSOR_OP GemmEx kullanilir. 1024, 2048 ve 4096 boyutlarinda multiply_into ham cuBLAS'i gecer; 4096'da 16,895 GFLOPS tepe verime ulasilir.",
            "en": "Large GEMM uses algo-cached cublasLt + TENSOR_OP GemmEx. At 1024, 2048, and 4096 sizes multiply_into beats raw cuBLAS, reaching up to 16,895 GFLOPS peak throughput at 4096."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "filename": "terminal",
          "code": "cmake --build --preset release --target matrix_pro_bench_comparison matrix_pro_bench_external_gemm matrix_pro_bench_training\n./build/benchmarks/Release/matrix_pro_bench_comparison.exe --sizes 256,512,1024,2048,4096 --warmup 12 --repeats 40 --json benchmarks/results/comparison.json\n./build/benchmarks/Release/matrix_pro_bench_external_gemm.exe --sizes 256,512,1024,2048 --warmup 12 --repeats 40 --json benchmarks/results/external_gemm.json\npy -3 tools/bench_rivals.py\npython tools/gen_bench_page.py\npython tools/sync_benchmark_data.py"
        }
      ]
    },
